@startuml Lihat_Produk
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Lihat Produk (View Products)
actor Customer
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Buka Aplikasi / Klik Menu Produk
App -> API: GET /api/products
API -> DB: Query Daftar Produk
DB --> API: Return Data Produk
API --> App: Response JSON (List Produk)
App -> App: Parse & Display Produk
App --> Customer: Tampilkan Daftar Produk dengan\n(Nama, Harga, Gambar, Stok)

alt Klik Detail Produk
    Customer -> App: Klik Salah Satu Produk
    App -> API: GET /api/products/{id}
    API -> DB: Query Detail Produk
    DB --> API: Return Data Detail
    API --> App: Response Detail Produk
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Detail Produk\n(Deskripsi Lengkap, Harga, Stok, Review)
end

@enduml